        "content": "<p>rvolosatovs edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14715\">PR #14715</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>set</code> is documented as <a href=\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/blob/463701e0f6c575a5d24ae31c2ec1e0ebf09d28e1/proposals/http/wit/types.wit#L226-L233\">*replacing* values</a>, therefore any existing values must first be cleared. Empty value list is treated as deletion.</p>\n<p>This fixes a bug, where a <code>set</code> on a full map fails when key is already present</p>\n<p>Follow-up to <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702</a> (see my review before I merged the PR)</p>\n<p>cc @xia-chao </p>\n</blockquote>",
